sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant ServiceProvider
    participant ServiceProviderApp
    participant WebView
    participant WalletAPI
    participant EUDIW

    note right of ServiceProvider: This describes cross-device flow
    activate ServiceProvider
    ServiceProvider->>WalletAPI: POST /pushed-auth, redirect uri scheme is not https
    activate WalletAPI
    WalletAPI-->>ServiceProvider: 200 PAR response
    deactivate WalletAPI
    ServiceProvider ->> ServiceProviderApp: Send request_uri for app
    ServiceProviderApp -->> WebView: GET /auth with request_id from PAR response
    WebView ->> WalletAPI: GET /auth with request_id from PAR response
    activate WalletAPI
    WalletAPI -->> WebView: 302 /login
    WebView ->> WalletAPI: /login
    activate WalletAPI
    WalletAPI -->> WebView: Deeplink for Wallet
    deactivate WalletAPI
    WebView->>EUDIW: open Wallet's OpenID4VP intent

    deactivate ServiceProvider

    activate EUDIW
    EUDIW->>WalletAPI: GET or POST /request.jwt/{request_id}
    activate WalletAPI
        WalletAPI -->> EUDIW: Wallet Request Object
        deactivate WalletAPI
    EUDIW->>EUDIW: get consent and prepare VP response

    EUDIW->>WalletAPI: POST /callback
    activate WalletAPI
    WalletAPI-->>EUDIW: redirectUri
    deactivate WalletAPI

    EUDIW-->> WebView: 302 redirectUri to original /oauth2/authorize
    activate WebView
    WebView->>WalletAPI: GET redirect to /oauth2/authorize
    activate WalletAPI
    WalletAPI-->>WebView: redirect to original redirect uri with code
    WebView ->> ServiceProviderApp: deeplink to intent with code
    deactivate WalletAPI
    deactivate EUDIW

    ServiceProviderApp->>ServiceProvider: return code from authentication
    activate ServiceProvider

    ServiceProvider->>WalletAPI: /token
    activate WalletAPI
    WalletAPI-->>ServiceProvider: TokenResponse
    deactivate WalletAPI
    ServiceProvider->>WalletAPI: /userinfo
    activate WalletAPI
    WalletAPI-->>ServiceProvider: UserInfoResponse with custom claims
    deactivate WalletAPI
    deactivate ServiceProvider
